              "name": "GINAH1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an awesome version of Taffy Apply Salad. I usually let the pineapply/marshmallow mixture and the vinegar/flour/juice/egg/sugar mixture sit in separate bowls overnight in the fridge and then assemble the salad right before serving. Delicious!"
